    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Beautiful Location; This is it !\r\nSituated on site extending to 1400 sqm, this beachfront bungalow/cottage is located on a beautiful beach suitable for swimming, fishing or whatever water activity floats your boat and of course fabulous views.\r\nIn need of a little T.L.C. this is an opportunity to further develop or just refresh to create an even more stunning property.\r\nOverlooking Castlemaine Harbour with panoramic views to Inch Beach, Rossbeigh and the Dingle Peninsula.\r\nAccommodation comprises of three bedrooms, a family bathroom, utility room, kitchen/dining and living extending to some 86 sqm.\r\nOutside the grounds are laid to lawn with a stone driveway and ample parking and turning.\r\nLocated 4.3km to Dooks Golf Club and just 10 minutes drive to Killorglin, 30 minutes to Killarney and 35 minutes from Kerry Airport.\r\nOil fired central heating, UPVC double glazing and all services connected.\r\nAwaiting BER."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway: 3m x 1.7m - Glazed entrance door\r\n\r\nMiddle Hallway: 4.3m x 1m\r\n\r\nRear Hallway: 1.3m x 3.2m\r\n\r\nLiving Room: 3.7m x 3.7m - Feature fireplace, window to front elevation\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: 3.7m x 3.7m - Cream kitchen units, tiled splash back\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 3m x 2.5m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3m x 3.3m - Window to front elevation\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 4.2m x 3.3m - Sea views\r\n\r\nBathroom: 3m x 2.9m - Tiled, bath with shower over, w.c, wash hand basin\r\n\r\nUtility/Lobby: 1.8m x 1.2m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning sea views\r\nBeachfront location\r\nOil fired central heating\r\nUPVC double glazing\r\nAmple parking and turning\r\nMuch further dev potential\r\nClose to school, shop and pub\r\nPrivate beach access"
      },
